Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.13,0:00:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Shinobu! Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.64,0:00:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Tatsuya!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.22,0:00:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Kazuya! Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.43,0:00:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Minami! Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.81,0:00:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Tatsuya. Kazuya. Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.61,0:00:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We've always been together\Nsince we were born.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.32,0:00:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,People said we were like triplets.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.71,0:01:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Uesugi Tatsuya aka Tacchan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.97,0:01:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Uesugi Kazuya aka Kacchan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.18,0:01:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They were twins.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.60,0:01:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Asakura Minami.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.98,0:01:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy days passed by like dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.53,0:01:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Our fathers loved baseball.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.58,0:01:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We followed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.77,0:02:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.81,0:02:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Two outs, bases loaded, in the seventh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.15,0:02:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,High-School Tournament at Ball Park Stadium\Nabruptly appeared before us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.03,0:02:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,To participate in the tournament\Nbecame our dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.92,0:02:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.80,0:02:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.97,0:02:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The three kids messed up their houses.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.80,0:02:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Our parents built\Na joint playhouse for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.94,0:02:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,My mother said...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.36,0:02:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If only we could\Nlive this way forever...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.84,0:03:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I need someone who catches my ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.47,0:03:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You need hard training\Nto go to High-School Tournament Ball Park.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.73,0:03:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.\NGirls can't play baseball there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.86,0:03:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Take me there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.95,0:03:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Take me to High-School Tournament Ball Park.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.27,0:04:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,< TOUCH >
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.32,0:05:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be going.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.04,0:05:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, Punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.12,0:05:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, Kazuya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.58,0:05:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, Minami.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.80,0:05:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You look cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.30,0:05:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is the winner's picture so small?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.06,0:05:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.60,0:05:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.54,0:06:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.97,0:06:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I slept late.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.18,0:06:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Very, Tatsuya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.35,0:06:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,All comic books!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.02,0:06:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind textbooks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.18,0:06:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They're at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.27,0:06:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Your uniform?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.94,0:06:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.99,0:06:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't you use a hanger?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.57,0:06:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go through!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.86,0:06:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,A crumpled hankie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.62,0:06:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's wet and smells!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.16,0:06:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.87,0:06:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.12,0:06:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.76,0:06:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.43,0:06:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you slept late.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.26,0:06:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Dump your stuffed animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.68,0:06:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,None of your concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.68,0:06:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.90,0:07:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.85,0:07:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You're mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.06,0:07:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- Devil.\N- Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.57,0:07:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.61,0:07:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll turn into a toad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.57,0:07:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- No.\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.95,0:07:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- No.\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.08,0:07:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.12,0:07:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.92,0:07:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Meisei High School
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.09,0:07:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Under protection of\Naristocrats and merchants...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.76,0:07:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It means the hobby of the rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.85,0:07:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Leonardo da Vinci's Mona Lisa\Nwas a result of such a hobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.60,0:07:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The hobby produced culture.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.31,0:07:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This Mona Lisa in the textbook...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.65,0:07:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a glamorous type.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.45,0:07:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Tatsuya.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.83,0:08:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What lesson are you taking?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.21,0:08:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Your teacher's class?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.79,0:08:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He was watching the girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.05,0:08:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, baldhead!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.13,0:08:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.13,0:08:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.30,0:08:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Baldhead!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.68,0:08:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.14,0:08:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't eat in class!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.77,0:08:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.21,0:08:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It breaks well. Terrific!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.29,0:08:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Very fast, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.96,0:08:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,About 87 mph.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.51,0:08:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Uesugi! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.23,0:09:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Catch it! Catch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.10,0:09:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.95,0:09:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Go home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.16,0:09:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You've taken a lot of pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.58,0:09:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember. I'm not soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.80,0:09:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice pitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.05,0:09:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice pitching.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.81,0:09:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, fastball.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.33,0:10:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Tatsuya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.29,0:10:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.30,0:10:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Tatsuya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.06,0:10:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Going home so soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.23,0:10:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to pitch?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.40,0:10:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw you in the Little League.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.78,0:10:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got a nice throwing arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.37,0:10:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Join my team.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.14,0:11:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Your brother shut them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.31,0:11:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll go to High-School Tournament Ball Park.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.11,0:11:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,He's made the team invincible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.36,0:11:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Harada, stop jabbering!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.57,0:11:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Or no supper!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.82,0:11:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to cheer him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.58,0:11:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.04,0:11:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.50,0:11:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. Minami did.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.80,0:11:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Does a blow hurt you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.51,0:11:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.85,0:11:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.97,0:11:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Rather...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.64,0:11:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Once the gong sounds, nothing matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.06,0:11:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Only boxers know by experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.33,0:12:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.37,0:12:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Be sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.76,0:12:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's talk...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.19,0:12:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Lina!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.69,0:12:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.75,0:12:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you to stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.54,0:12:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.00,0:12:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Blame yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.38,0:12:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.85,0:13:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Change your clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.89,0:13:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do? So dirty all over!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.61,0:13:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You really know what you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.44,0:13:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.74,0:13:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you have a dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.99,0:13:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything you want to do in the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.08,0:13:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You've always been like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.54,0:13:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Doing this and that,\Nwithout a steadfast purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.97,0:13:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.52,0:13:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What a fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.78,0:14:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.18,0:14:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,...Ecole de Paris,\Na group of artists after WW1...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.23,0:14:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Minami, have some tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.85,0:14:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.23,0:14:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,These amulets are nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.99,0:14:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Very cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.62,0:14:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,How many will you make?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.45,0:14:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Twenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.04,0:15:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So many? Hard work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.42,0:15:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Enoshima Island...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.80,0:15:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not good at sewing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.63,0:15:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You do it all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.77,0:15:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So I stealthily went upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.02,0:15:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,They were discussing seriously\Nwho'd marry Minami.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.74,0:15:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They were schoolboys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.95,0:15:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You have the right to choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.87,0:15:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Which one would?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.50,0:15:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Tatsuya? Kazuya? Who'd marry me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.09,0:15:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The one who takes you to High-School Tournament Ball Park.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.48,0:16:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I started boxing practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.74,0:16:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Boxing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.08,0:16:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Why boxing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.37,0:16:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not baseball?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.04,0:16:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.67,0:16:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Your fastball was great.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.26,0:16:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It swished as you threw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.27,0:16:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Speed is a talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.69,0:16:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Breaking balls depend on practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.45,0:16:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you quit baseball?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.04,0:17:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.50,0:17:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Why you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.64,0:17:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! Terrific, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.68,0:17:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Lina shows all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.77,0:18:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,One more minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.39,0:18:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Asakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.56,0:18:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.36,0:18:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.16,0:18:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a tough guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.47,0:18:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Meisei Keeps Going
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.43,0:18:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,13 Strikeouts
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.18,0:18:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Meisei Wins Again!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.16,0:19:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.28,0:19:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.45,0:19:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You're no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.16,0:19:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,One more game!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.68,0:19:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,A punching bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.10,0:19:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.64,0:19:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.56,0:19:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.54,0:19:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Today's match. We got to win!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.96,0:19:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't slip down, ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.86,0:20:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The last ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.87,0:20:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Strikeout! That's his fast slider!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.87,0:20:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Uesugi led Meisei to the final.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.28,0:21:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay on the mat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.42,0:21:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.88,0:21:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He forgot this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.84,0:21:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He left after the match.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.40,0:21:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He practiced very hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.57,0:21:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He was serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.78,0:21:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But he lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.96,0:22:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,He tried his best.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.84,0:22:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He looked cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.81,0:22:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.95,0:22:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.42,0:22:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, the final.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.75,0:22:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Kazuya's in a good condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.34,0:22:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,My father's compliment.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.01,0:22:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,How heavy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.34,0:22:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Best beef from Kobe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.85,0:22:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's make Sukiyaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.69,0:23:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,How was Tatsuya?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.20,0:23:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The boxing team Manager came.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.99,0:23:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Tatsuya lost the game\Nbut he tried hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.21,0:23:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He did his best.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.77,0:23:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Supper!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.73,0:23:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Sukiyaki for supper.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.31,0:23:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.82,0:23:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The match is over. No more diet.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.25,0:24:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Harada coached me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.88,0:24:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You did your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.26,0:24:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.93,0:24:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not so simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.98,0:24:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.15,0:24:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,A sweetie would...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.49,0:24:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,...smack a kiss without a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.16,0:25:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Take three meals a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.40,0:27:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Harada! Get moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.70,0:28:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you so cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.29,0:28:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What about?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.13,0:28:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What about?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.63,0:28:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?\NIs that so simple a thing to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.93,0:28:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.31,0:28:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you kiss me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.98,0:28:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it on a whim.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.69,0:28:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.62,0:28:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It was for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.96,0:28:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Just for you, Tatsuya.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.52,0:29:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Ishigaki, left fielder.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.61,0:29:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Just knock a grounder and run.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.36,0:29:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.61,0:29:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakajima, shortstop.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.74,0:29:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hit the first ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.41,0:29:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hit a home run.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.16,0:29:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,As always!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.58,0:29:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Not as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.55,0:29:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Lastly, Asakura, scorer.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.76,0:29:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a rest today\Nfor the game tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.81,0:29:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Get over your fatigue.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.44,0:30:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,One more game to High-School Tournament Ball Park.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.28,0:30:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Kazuya.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.41,0:30:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.75,0:30:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Nitta is a slugger.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.84,0:30:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,His average is 0.750.\NIn the elimination.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.92,0:30:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.09,0:30:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You faced him before?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.01,0:30:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Just once in junior high.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.64,0:30:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I shut him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.98,0:30:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Minami. Another round.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.15,0:30:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat some sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.32,0:30:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But you can't tell\Nwhat will happen next.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.21,0:31:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I assure you. You'll win.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.38,0:31:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Will the goddess of victory kiss me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.44,0:31:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.15,0:31:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Kazuya will have a game tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.65,0:31:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Tatsuya, you have nothing to do today?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.25,0:31:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We're short of hands.\NJoin my team for a day. I'll pay for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.38,0:31:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?\NI'd get only half my pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.89,0:32:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You bring Kazuya?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.56,0:32:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll have the final tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.11,0:32:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,He just came.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.90,0:32:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Too large for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.24,0:32:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it washed clean?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.33,0:32:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.24,0:32:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How about a bet?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.12,0:32:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner will get what he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.89,0:32:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it easy, Kazuya.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.19,0:32:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.57,0:32:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no. He's a jewel in a dunghill.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.66,0:32:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.27,0:33:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.18,0:34:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.44,0:34:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The Sumi High batters\Nare immune to breaking balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.23,0:34:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You can fan them.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.16,0:35:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Just don't have a\Nrunner on base before Nitta.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.75,0:35:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in a good condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.84,0:35:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be hot tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.06,0:35:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to bed now. Team secretaries\Nmust get up early in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.44,0:35:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Tough work, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.65,0:35:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.00,0:35:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.79,0:35:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Minami.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.63,0:36:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember what I said in the cafe?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.64,0:36:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you kiss me?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.60,0:36:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as a charm.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.78,0:36:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll be able to sleep soundly.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.65,0:37:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Good night, Manager Asakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.00,0:38:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to play catch?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.34,0:38:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.45,0:38:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.31,0:38:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Bro, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.61,0:39:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I kissed Minami.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.33,0:39:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,On the forehead.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.30,0:39:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Why report that to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.18,0:39:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.93,0:39:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Even kids kiss on the forehead.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.11,0:39:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Take her...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.16,0:39:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,...to High-School Tournament Ball Park Stadium.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.53,0:39:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's your task.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.67,0:40:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to see...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.54,0:40:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,...her smiling face?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.10,0:40:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Win the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.27,0:40:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Never lose it!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.65,0:40:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.49,0:40:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You could have invited me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.08,0:40:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's play triangular catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.34,0:40:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, let's!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.57,0:41:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We used to do this every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.74,0:41:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,All day until dusk.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.33,0:41:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What interested us?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.25,0:41:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I was fascinated.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.09,0:41:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Aunt Haruko was angry\Nbecause we were late.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.64,0:41:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,She came...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.95,0:41:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Minami.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.12,0:42:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The memories are dear to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.88,0:42:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.92,0:42:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.59,0:42:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.70,0:43:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,One more!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.78,0:43:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Minami.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.75,0:43:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Minami...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.71,0:43:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.34,0:43:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.89,0:43:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.68,0:43:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.06,0:43:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.21,0:44:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.80,0:44:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Uesugi will come.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.51,0:44:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hang in there until then.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.16,0:44:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Nitta gets to his feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.66,0:44:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The slugger is at bat\Nwith runners on bases.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.77,0:45:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, cheer up!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.98,0:45:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Uesugi absent? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.21,0:45:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He hit it hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.63,0:45:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,To the right field!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.34,0:45:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Deep! Deep!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.55,0:45:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Gone! A home run!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.02,0:45:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The excited supporters!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.56,0:45:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The pitcher gives way to the mound.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.06,0:46:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The homer has cleared the bases.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.03,0:46:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Sumi High wins 4-3.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.28,0:46:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The team is going to High-School Tournament Ball Park\Nfor the 17th time.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.26,0:46:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Kazuya... Kazuya...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.90,0:48:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.07,0:48:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.27,0:49:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Sumi High Wins Championship at High-School Tournament Ball Park
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.64,0:50:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Uesugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.19,0:50:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,A nice job for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.78,0:50:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He's offering a bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.61,0:51:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You pitch; he swings.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.62,0:51:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It pays 10,000 yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.16,0:51:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If struck out, another 10,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.66,0:51:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You throw, that's all. A good deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.50,0:51:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I win, you'll join my team.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.59,0:51:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,He's captain. He needs a pitcher.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.35,0:51:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,My last request.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.56,0:51:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If you win, I won't bother you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.08,0:51:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Genuine.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.19,0:53:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Will he make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.40,0:53:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It depends.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.41,0:53:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakajima, drop the ball at the waist!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.50,0:53:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Why all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.75,0:53:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.29,0:53:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Baseball.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.00,0:53:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.88,0:53:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.80,0:53:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have to consult you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.93,0:53:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't I play baseball?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.64,0:53:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Look at the mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.56,0:53:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Your whim can cause\Na shock to the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.35,0:53:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I look like Kazuya?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.61,0:53:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Naturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.07,0:53:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.19,0:53:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.70,0:53:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.75,0:53:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,In a uniform, he's Kazuya.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.42,0:53:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.54,0:54:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Kazuya's partner,\Nand he's not Kazuya.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.07,0:54:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You intentionally lost the bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.35,0:54:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I am exhausted this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.81,0:54:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.73,0:55:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.90,0:55:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But they'll become tough that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.91,0:55:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.63,0:55:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course. You're team Manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.47,0:55:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I found these under his bed.\NHe hid them there.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.97,0:55:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He tells me nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.39,0:55:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't he trust his own mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.81,0:55:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.69,0:55:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Minami.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.90,0:55:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't you tell him to quit baseball?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.65,0:55:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.49,0:55:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Why ask her that?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.45,0:55:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't Tatsuya play baseball?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.33,0:56:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you quit boxing?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.76,0:56:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You went for it. Wasn't it fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.18,0:56:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.02,0:56:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not Kazuya.\NYou don't have to bear his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.31,0:56:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.27,0:56:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.61,0:56:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I like baseball, so I play it.\NCan't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.82,0:56:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No. You don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.36,0:56:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Minami, persuade him.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.12,0:56:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.51,0:56:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Uesugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.05,0:56:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.14,0:57:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.07,0:57:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Throw.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.71,0:57:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotaro, catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.17,0:57:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.75,0:57:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.42,0:57:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't be a pitcher.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.01,0:57:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.35,0:57:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody, catch his ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.57,0:57:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.91,0:58:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,No. You're in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.96,0:58:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.54,0:58:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Minami Asakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.02,0:59:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You afraid?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.19,0:59:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind hurting me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.03,1:00:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Be serious!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.62,1:00:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that your fastball?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.97,1:01:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.43,1:01:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.50,1:01:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.21,1:01:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You never get tired?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.30,1:01:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Nitta of Sum High...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.47,1:01:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds familiar.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.52,1:01:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.86,1:02:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Sumi High won the championship.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.65,1:02:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The credit goes to Nitta.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.03,1:02:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The freshman is the\Nnumber-one slugger...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.37,1:02:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We faced him, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.21,1:02:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,At the final.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.34,1:02:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,About today...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.56,1:02:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.30,1:03:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't interfere!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.97,1:03:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't interfere!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.77,1:03:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.69,1:03:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.32,1:03:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You hurt me!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.63,1:03:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.85,1:03:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.18,1:03:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.18,1:04:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.50,1:05:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,77th Tokyo Regional Tournament\Nin Autumn
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.68,1:05:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Strike!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.22,1:05:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice pitching!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.65,1:05:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Strike!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.53,1:05:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Will he throw to the last?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.11,1:05:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a month.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.87,1:05:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He's throwing hard.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.41,1:05:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ball! Walk!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.42,1:05:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Tatsuya, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.13,1:05:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's she?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.72,1:05:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you in the dugout today?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.76,1:06:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the next one.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.04,1:06:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ball!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.34,1:06:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you mind?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.93,1:06:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.64,1:06:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Nitta.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.77,1:06:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You work hard.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.06,1:06:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You have your own game.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.73,1:06:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.36,1:06:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We won 12-0. A called game.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.90,1:06:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It was boring.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.49,1:07:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Ball!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.83,1:07:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He's terrible. Can't be twins.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.04,1:07:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Tatsuya and Kazuya\Nare two different boys.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.84,1:07:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What's funny?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.09,1:07:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You're cute.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.97,1:07:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking for trouble?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.56,1:07:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Harada.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.35,1:07:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about how to\Ndeal with Kazuya.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.03,1:07:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,In the Little League...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.36,1:07:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The third Sunday in November,\Nat Musashi Ballpark...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.00,1:07:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The game started at 10:00.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.62,1:07:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a beautiful day.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.67,1:07:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I was at bat first\Nin the top of second inning.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.05,1:08:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,He threw in a perfect form.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.31,1:08:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it was a fastball.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.31,1:08:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I swung without hesitation.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.15,1:08:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But the ball curved abruptly.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.03,1:08:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ball!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.82,1:08:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't believe it...\Na fast breaking ball!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.91,1:08:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I was panicked...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.29,1:08:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,...by that single ball.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.92,1:08:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot the rest.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.85,1:08:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I struck out.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.93,1:08:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,My average was 0.800,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.02,1:08:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,but my bat couldn't touch his ball.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.57,1:09:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I could hit his ball once...\NKazuya Uesugi.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.65,1:09:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Bases-loaded walk...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.28,1:09:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No control...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.70,1:09:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,A barrage of hits...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.49,1:09:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Knocked out of the box...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.79,1:09:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,A called game...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.76,1:10:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Uesugi say anything?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.68,1:10:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.26,1:10:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Let him alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.89,1:10:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamada! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.36,1:10:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Kazuya...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.40,1:10:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stand in you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.20,1:10:32.70,Song,,0,0,0,,Looking back at the road\NI've trod along,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.87,1:10:39.38,Song,,0,0,0,,I find myself muffled with your smile,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.54,1:10:45.97,Song,,0,0,0,,muddy sneakers and the\Nsongs you croon.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.18,1:10:54.81,Song,,0,0,0,,I want the nearness of you\Non starlit nights.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.02,1:11:01.44,Song,,0,0,0,,When I realize it,\Ntears well in my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.61,1:11:08.28,Song,,0,0,0,,Is there anything I can do for you?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.49,1:11:14.91,Song,,0,0,0,,I want to impart this feeling to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.12,1:11:21.42,Song,,0,0,0,,But I can't even think of a word.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.59,1:11:28.59,Song,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow we'll be able to\Nsmile at each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.80,1:11:34.77,Song,,0,0,0,,For I believe it anytime.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.93,1:11:43.98,Song,,0,0,0,,On a chilly morning,\Non a rainy afternoon...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.53,1:11:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Where will we go next?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.79,1:11:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,How cute!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.54,1:12:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a long way to drive. Go by train.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.29,1:12:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems Tatsuya quit baseball.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.01,1:12:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.47,1:12:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't look happy playing baseball.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.88,1:12:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be going.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.21,1:12:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.42,1:12:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.23,1:13:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take Kazuya to High-School Tournament Ball Park.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.15,1:13:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He never tried to escape.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.49,1:14:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He tried to go to High-School Tournament Ball Park\Nfor our dream.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.75,1:14:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not Kazuya.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.59,1:14:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,High-School Tournament Ball Park was just a dream.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.76,1:14:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He was desperate.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.64,1:14:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But then I fell in love with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.61,1:14:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But he...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.03,1:14:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He tried to make our dream come true.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.41,1:14:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Where should his passion run to?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.97,1:14:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try by myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.64,1:15:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.64,1:15:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.64,1:15:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Minami!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.18,1:15:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.02,1:15:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.15,1:15:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't bother me!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.61,1:15:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Minami...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.95,1:15:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Minami...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.83,1:15:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Minami...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.17,1:15:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The three of us...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.34,1:15:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't return to what we used to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.58,1:16:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Minami left the team.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.50,1:16:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The manager said he received her resignation letter yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.09,1:17:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Shimada, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.19,1:17:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What a jerk, Kazuya!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.44,1:17:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You died so quickly.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.41,1:17:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm having a hard time for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.35,1:17:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't recall it...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.69,1:18:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Minami's smiling face.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.83,1:18:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Kazuya.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.00,1:18:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Say something.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.55,1:18:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Got hit. You lack training.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.10,1:18:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You're hopelessly stupid.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.57,1:18:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Minami has been away from\Nthe dugout since Kazuya died.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.99,1:18:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.75,1:18:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Afraid of the memory.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.50,1:19:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,She's trying hard\Nwith the wound in her heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.05,1:19:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see Kazuya.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.72,1:19:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What for?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.22,1:19:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll knock him down.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.02,1:19:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You really want that?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.49,1:19:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Then fight in the same ring.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.29,1:19:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What ring?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.87,1:19:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,See You.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.25,1:19:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Come anytime for my advice.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.31,1:19:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Who wants your advice?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.45,1:20:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go to High-School Tournament Ball Park. Wait, Minami.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.99,1:21:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! Tatsuya!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.16,1:21:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the big idea?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.54,1:21:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You went away and came back.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.04,1:21:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,How selfish!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.38,1:21:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You should consult your partner.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.72,1:22:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's play catch.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.56,1:22:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotaro!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.56,1:22:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.94,1:22:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Too late.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.57,1:22:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go to High-School Tournament Ball Park Stadium!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.58,1:22:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The sun shines on Musashi Field.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.71,1:22:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Echoing in our schoolhouse are
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.80,1:22:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,the singing voices of our friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.64,1:22:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The new age is breaking here now
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.60,1:22:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,in Meisei High School in Tokyo!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.36,1:22:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be a nice team.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.27,1:24:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the beautiful summer sky!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.69,1:24:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,At Jingu Ballpark under the blue sky,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.61,1:25:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,the final will be fought\Nfor the ticket to High-School Tournament Ball Park.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.03,1:25:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sumi High vs. Meisei.\NThey met at the final last year, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.37,1:25:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Destiny willed this match.\NIt'll be an exciting game.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.75,1:25:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.63,1:25:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,As for the Meisei team,\Na sad incident happened last year.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.47,1:25:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Kazuya Uesugi, the ace pitcher,\Ndied in a traffic accident.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.89,1:25:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He was talented and promising.\NIt was a great loss.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.81,1:25:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Tatsuya Uesugi, on the mound today,\Nis his twin brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.69,1:25:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,He joined the baseball team\Nto follow his great brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.79,1:25:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Bullshit!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.89,1:26:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The game starts at 13:00.\NCome watch it, if you like.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.35,1:26:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Western Tokyo Elimination final\Nfor High-School Tournament Ball Park on air
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.23,1:26:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Please come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.98,1:27:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me watch it.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.57,1:27:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Haruko?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.82,1:27:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,She's too sensitive.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.36,1:27:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Beer?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.78,1:27:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.58,1:27:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,...Sumi High at the final again.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.37,1:27:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,They want to win the\Nnational championship again.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.97,1:27:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Punch...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.32,1:27:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Strike!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.75,1:28:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! Uesugi fanned the first batter!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.13,1:28:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Uesugi's made a good start.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.68,1:28:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Strike!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.23,1:28:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,For Nitta, low and away.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.65,1:28:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's his weak point.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.11,1:28:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Never heard of.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.90,1:28:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Minami sent me her notebook.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.95,1:28:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe her.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.95,1:28:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Strike!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.41,1:28:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Strikeout swinging!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.04,1:28:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsukuda fanned the fourth\Nand fifth batters in a row.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.91,1:29:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The fourth batter, Nitta,\Nthird baseman.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.56,1:29:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Nitta is first at bat in this inning\NSumi High's cleanup hitter.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.94,1:29:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,His average up to the final is 0.700...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.07,1:29:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Be quiet!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.41,1:29:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The game's on!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.16,1:30:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,...not only Sumi High's.\NHe's the All-Japan Team's cleanup hitter.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.54,1:30:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Nitta is slowly entering\Nthe batter's box.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.13,1:30:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The top of second inning.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.14,1:30:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Uesugi, fight!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.93,1:30:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, batters!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.36,1:30:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Strike!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.49,1:30:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.66,1:30:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it! He's never\Nhit a ball low on the outside.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.96,1:30:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,...Uesugi throws a fast and heavy ball.\NNitta watched it.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.13,1:30:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He takes a stance.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.34,1:31:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The outfielders stay positioned\Na little deeper than usual...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.07,1:31:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Uesugi is throwing hard\Nfrom the first pitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.95,1:31:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,He's calm but aggressive.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.61,1:31:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He has no breaking balls...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.42,1:31:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I quit baseball.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.39,1:31:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.65,1:32:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A long fly! Deep! Deep!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.07,1:32:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Foul! Just out of the line.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.29,1:32:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Meisei must be thrilled.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.12,1:32:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought it's inside the line.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.00,1:33:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He caught it! A fine play!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.22,1:33:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Uesugi jumped hard.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.64,1:33:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.77,1:33:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.86,1:33:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He touches his shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.86,1:33:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems he sprained his right ankle!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.32,1:33:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He fell in a funny way,\Nthe shoulder first.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.91,1:33:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Can he throw? I'm worried.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.10,1:33:57.57,Song,,0,0,0,,Stop breathing for a second\Nfor your eyes looked serious.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.77,1:34:02.95,Song,,0,0,0,,There my ears stopped hearing.\NStardust loneliness.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.11,1:34:09.12,Song,,0,0,0,,Because I cherish only my love.\NI'm so timid of hearing other voices.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.29,1:34:13.83,Song,,0,0,0,,I pretend not to see my teardrops.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.17,1:34:20.55,Song,,0,0,0,,How many times have we\Ncrossed each other?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.75,1:34:27.18,Song,,0,0,0,,How many detours must we take\Nto touch each other?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.39,1:34:31.18,Song,,0,0,0,,Please touch me. Touch me here.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.39,1:34:34.23,Song,,0,0,0,,Reach for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.44,1:34:41.15,Song,,0,0,0,,Hold out your hand and\Nreceive this bouquet
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.32,1:34:46.82,Song,,0,0,0,,of flowers that bloom in my sigh.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.66,1:34:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuroki hit a double,\Nsending Nakajima home.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.75,1:35:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Meisei scored first, 1-0.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.14,1:35:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Winning?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.27,1:35:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a fat chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.11,1:35:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The southpaw throws. Ogawara swings.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.44,1:35:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,First base line! Fair!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.57,1:35:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Mihara comes home.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.99,1:35:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuroki slides! A close play!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.29,1:35:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Safe! Meisei scores two more.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.21,1:35:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuroki slid safely.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.13,1:35:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The ball returned a little too late.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.59,1:35:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Meisei hit well and ran well.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.72,1:35:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,They earned three runs.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.69,1:36:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Two outs, the top of sixth inning,\Nbases loaded.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.28,1:36:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Nitta is at bat.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.44,1:36:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,A homer is expected.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.91,1:36:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Gone! Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.04,1:36:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,A grand slam! Sumi High scored four.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.04,1:36:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,They came from behind,\Nand now take a 4-3 lead.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.98,1:36:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The bottom of eighth inning.\NThe score: 4-3.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.90,1:36:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,One out, Uesugi on second base.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.49,1:36:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Uesugi all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.03,1:36:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,He has another inning to throw.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.45,1:37:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ogawara bunts.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.63,1:37:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,A fast runner on first base.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.27,1:37:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Meisei is a nice team.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.98,1:37:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Enjoy the game?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.11,1:37:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Best.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.05,1:38:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Safe!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.88,1:38:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Out!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.18,1:38:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Out! Uesugi was called out.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.85,1:38:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He slid to the plate,\Nbut the catcher blocked him.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.61,1:38:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.07,1:38:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Did the Manager sign him to?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.16,1:38:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.87,1:39:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,His own judgment.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.59,1:39:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotaro Matsudaira is at bat.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.17,1:39:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Meisei's cleanup hitter.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.22,1:39:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,As catcher, he wants to even the score\Nat least for the pitcher.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.10,1:39:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But he's not doing well today.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.00,1:39:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,one! Goodbye! A home run!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:53.63,1:39:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He did it! A two-run home run!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:56.55,1:40:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He finally proved to be\Na cleanup hitter.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.15,1:40:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,A good job!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.07,1:40:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Meisei scored two runs\Nin the bottom of eighth inning.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.91,1:40:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Kazuya...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:27.00,1:40:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He made it.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.34,1:40:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Two outs, a runner on first.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.81,1:40:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,One more out to win.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.02,1:40:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Uesugi throws. Ozaki hits!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.36,1:40:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hit into left-center field!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:56.48,1:40:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The left fielder catches it,\Nthrows home...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.20,1:41:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Two outs, runners on second and third.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.74,1:41:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,A chance for a\Ncome-from-behind victory.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:10.91,1:41:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Nitta, who hit a grand slam, is next.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.00,1:41:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an exciting game.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.11,1:41:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Fatigue is ailing the pitcher.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.74,1:41:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,His shoulder must have been damaged.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.24,1:41:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Two hits in a row.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.25,1:41:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Sumi by one, and one more out to win.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.67,1:42:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's wise to give him\Nan intentional walk.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.26,1:42:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He's too tough to challenge.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.73,1:42:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Time, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:18.36,1:42:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Time, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.04,1:42:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Give him a walk.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.13,1:42:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the fifth batter.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.92,1:42:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,To High-School Tournament Ball Park!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:48.76,1:42:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Kazuya would do so, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.06,1:42:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Kuroki?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.65,1:42:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Uesugi.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.32,1:43:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. Back to your position.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.57,1:43:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Go back.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.14,1:43:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Shortstop, closer to second!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:41.90,1:43:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Outfielders, near the fence!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.87,1:43:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.33,1:43:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,One more out!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:58.50,1:44:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go to High-School Tournament Ball Park!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:27.90,1:44:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Those stupid fools...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.91,1:44:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Meisei seems to be challenging Nitta.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.08,1:44:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Tatsuya.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.04,1:44:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheer them up with a fight call.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.88,1:44:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, three!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.53,1:45:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows what will happen next?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:34.55,1:45:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Strike!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:56.28,1:45:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Minami.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:05.67,1:46:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. Kazuya...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:08.21,1:46:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You used to look for Minami\Nfrom the mound like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:28.69,1:46:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're here...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.61,1:46:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Here with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.91,1:46:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:41.95,1:46:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Kazuya.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:14.32,1:47:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Strike!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:16.45,1:47:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The ball sank curving.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:18.53,1:47:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Uesugi has a breaking ball, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:22.58,1:47:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Kazuya?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.62,1:47:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Kazuya!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:31.54,1:47:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,No ball, two strikes.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:33.76,1:47:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole ballpark\Nis in a tense atmosphere.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:37.59,1:47:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The cheering groups of both teams\Nare heated up.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:41.68,1:47:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Uesugi must be exhausted, but
Dialogue: 0,1:47:48.73,1:47:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,his ball seems to have\Ngained more speed.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:53.19,1:47:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Nitta swung to miss. Uesugi is\Ngathering his remaining strength.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:57.61,1:48:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The final of the Western\NTokyo Regional Elimination.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:01.20,1:48:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner will go to High-School Tournament Ball Park\Nfor the all-Japan championship.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:08.58,1:48:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.33,1:48:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.13,1:48:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:17.92,1:48:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Go...!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.80,1:48:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Go...!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.82,1:48:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:39.15,1:48:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take Minami to High-School Tournament Ball Park.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:28.91,1:49:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Strike!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.12,1:49:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Game's over!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:37.13,1:49:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:49.68,1:49:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Meisei wins! Uesugi fanned Nitta!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:56.27,1:50:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,His last fastball went straight\Nto the catcher.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:01.61,1:50:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Meisei defeated the last champion.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:05.66,1:50:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They won the regional eliminator...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:09.37,1:50:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,to represent the 120 participants in it at the High-School Tournament Ball Park.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:13.12,1:50:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Sumi High also deserves admiration.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:17.92,1:50:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Meisei will go to High-School Tournament Ball Park Stadium\Nin summer this year.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:37.00,1:51:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Tatsuya Uesugi loves Minami
Dialogue: 0,1:51:41.71,1:51:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,more than anybody else!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:49.55,1:51:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.77,1:52:12.86,ED,,0,0,0,,I looked upside down at the cold sky, and looked down at the city that was crying and turning red.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:13.16,1:52:21.46,ED,,0,0,0,,Being blown away by the wind, I surrender my body and laugh, it’s surprisingly tough
Dialogue: 0,1:52:21.63,1:52:24.42,ED,,0,0,0,,The journey continues
Dialogue: 0,1:52:24.42,1:52:30.76,ED,,0,0,0,,I'll give you the blue necklace.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:30.97,1:52:41.81,ED,,0,0,0,,If she eats the poisoned apple, she'll fall off the stage!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:42.73,1:52:44.86,ED,,0,0,0,,Please retie it.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:48.99,1:53:00.50,ED,,0,0,0,,Let's grow the seeds of joy\N that we miss in the warm earth.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:00.50,1:53:06.42,ED,,0,0,0,,I get swept away, I run out of energy...
Dialogue: 0,1:53:06.42,1:53:11.80,ED,,0,0,0,,and being moved by something big.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:25.65,1:53:36.74,ED,,0,0,0,,I can watch the dream of my dreams, the magic song, and she can watch it whenever I want.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:37.45,1:53:48.80,ED,,0,0,0,,Where will she go to invite that person?\N She will write a letter to give to tomorrow that shines into the future.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:48.80,1:53:58.47,ED,,0,0,0,,Even though she knows it's full of mistakes, the two of them keep moving forward.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:58.81,1:54:11.11,ED,,0,0,0,,In other words, you have the ticket to be happy without fear.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:12.36,1:54:17.74,ED,,0,0,0,,The smell of sunshine, the sky just after the rain!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:18.62,1:54:23.87,ED,,0,0,0,,Let's take it for the granted!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:24.96,1:54:27.34,ED,,0,0,0,,Let's be scolded...
Dialogue: 0,1:54:27.34,1:54:29.92,ED,,0,0,0,,Let's be loved...
Dialogue: 0,1:54:30.96,1:54:35.97,ED,,0,0,0,,Let's believe from the depths of our hearts!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:42.93,1:54:45.19,ED,,0,0,0,,The sun rises and then sets...
Dialogue: 0,1:54:45.19,1:54:48.27,ED,,0,0,0,,He blazes in crimson...
Dialogue: 0,1:54:48.27,1:54:54.57,ED,,0,0,0,,Listen carefully to the sound of life
Dialogue: 0,1:54:54.57,1:54:59.95,ED,,0,0,0,,Let's make this seed of joy bear fruit
Dialogue: 0,1:55:00.83,1:55:06.04,ED,,0,0,0,,Let's pour out the water called love
Dialogue: 0,1:55:06.54,1:55:09.63,ED,,0,0,0,,The smell of sunshine, the sky after the rain
Dialogue: 0,1:55:12.63,1:55:17.80,ED,,0,0,0,,Let's take it for the granted!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:18.88,1:55:30.06,ED,,0,0,0,,Let's grow the seeds of joy\N that we miss in the warm earth.
